§§ `The patient`

§§§ `ss 7, 8, 55(1)`

-- s 7(3)(a)
#ASSERT `Is the care I receive a public health service` `as the patient` `a health service provider` FALSE FALSE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Is the care I receive a public health service` `as the patient` `a private provider with no such contract` FALSE FALSE EQUALS no
-- s 7(4)(b)
#ASSERT `Is the care I receive a public health service` `as the patient` `a health service provider` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `yes if` (`Is my care a public health service` `a health service provider` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `Is the care I receive a public health service` `as the family member` `an unasked provider` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Is the care I receive a public health service` `as the payer` `an unasked provider` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Is the care I receive a public health service` `as the holder` `an unasked provider` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
-- k090: run by a health service provider, s 8(6)(a)
#ASSERT `Is my hospital a public hospital` `as the patient` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Is my hospital a public hospital` `as the patient` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS no
-- s 8(8)
#ASSERT `Is my hospital a public hospital` `as the patient` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `yes if` (`Is the hospital a public hospital` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `Is my hospital a public hospital` `as the family member` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Is my hospital a public hospital` `as the payer` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Is my hospital a public hospital` `as the holder` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
-- finding 1: s 55(1)
#ASSERT `May the health service provider charge me at all` `as the patient` `a health service provider` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS yes
-- s 55(1)(a)
#ASSERT `May the health service provider charge me at all` `as the patient` `a health service provider` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS no
-- s 55(1)(b)
#ASSERT `May the health service provider charge me at all` `as the patient` `a health service provider` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `yes if` (`May the hospital charge me at all` `a health service provider` FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `May the health service provider charge me at all` `as the family member` `an unasked provider` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
