-- workers' compensation applies: cl 12(3)(a)
#ASSERT `Am I a compensable patient for hospital charges` `as the patient` `as an in-patient` TRUE `workers compensation, catastrophic injuries or Defence Force law applies, or appears to apply, to paying for my treatment` EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Am I a compensable patient for hospital charges` `as the patient` `as an in-patient` TRUE `none of these` EQUALS no
-- finding 6: a compensable same day patient must be eligible, cl 3A(4)(a)
#ASSERT `Am I a compensable patient for hospital charges` `as the patient` `as a same day patient` FALSE `I have, or appear to have, another right to compensation for this condition, and the chief executive has not decided I am not compensable` EQUALS no
-- finding 6: but compensable as an in-patient; the baseline's answer on the same facts
#ASSERT `Am I a compensable patient for hospital charges` `as the patient` `as an in-patient` FALSE `I have, or appear to have, another right to compensation for this condition, and the chief executive has not decided I am not compensable` EQUALS `yes if` (`Am I a compensable patient` `a visitor with a right to compensation` `as an in-patient`)
#ASSERT `Am I a compensable patient for hospital charges` `as the patient` `as an out-patient` TRUE `workers compensation, catastrophic injuries or Defence Force law applies, or appears to apply, to paying for my treatment` EQUALS `yes if` (`Am I a compensable patient` `a worker with an accepted compensation claim` `as an out-patient`)
-- cl 3A(5): a right to compensation the chief executive has ruled out is `none of these`
#ASSERT `Am I a compensable patient for hospital charges` `as the patient` `as an in-patient` TRUE `none of these` EQUALS `yes if` (`Am I a compensable patient` `a patient the chief executive has decided is not compensable` `as an in-patient`)
#ASSERT `Am I a compensable patient for hospital charges` `as the patient` `as an in-patient` TRUE `motor vehicle third party insurance applies, or appears to apply, to paying for my treatment` EQUALS `yes if` (`Am I a compensable patient` `a patient hurt in a motor vehicle accident` `as an in-patient`)
#ASSERT `Am I a compensable patient for hospital charges` `as the family member` `an unasked attendance` `an unasked fact` `an unasked compensation` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Am I a compensable patient for hospital charges` `as the payer` `an unasked attendance` `an unasked fact` `an unasked compensation` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Am I a compensable patient for hospital charges` `as the holder` `an unasked attendance` `an unasked fact` `an unasked compensation` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
