#ASSERT `Am I free of all hospital fees and charges under cl 6A` `as the patient` `as an in-patient` TRUE `none of these` FALSE EQUALS no
-- a compensable patient is not free under cl 6A
#ASSERT `Am I free of all hospital fees and charges under cl 6A` `as the patient` `as an in-patient` FALSE `workers compensation, catastrophic injuries or Defence Force law applies, or appears to apply, to paying for my treatment` TRUE EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Am I free of all hospital fees and charges under cl 6A` `as the patient` `as an in-patient` FALSE `none of these` TRUE EQUALS `yes if` (`Am I free of all fees under cl 6A` `an asylum seeker awaiting a protection visa` `as an in-patient`)
#ASSERT `Am I free of all hospital fees and charges under cl 6A` `as the family member` `an unasked attendance` `an unasked fact` `an unasked compensation` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Am I free of all hospital fees and charges under cl 6A` `as the payer` `an unasked attendance` `an unasked fact` `an unasked compensation` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Am I free of all hospital fees and charges under cl 6A` `as the holder` `an unasked attendance` `an unasked fact` `an unasked compensation` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
