§§§ `Order cll 5, 6, Schedule 1 Divisions 1 and 2`

-- c060, k090: item 1(a)
#ASSERT `What does the public hospital charge me per day for my stay` `as the patient` `a public in-patient` FALSE `an ordinary hospital bed` `none of these` EQUALS `the hospital's charge` `nothing to pay`
-- item 1(b)(ii)
#ASSERT `What does the public hospital charge me per day for my stay` `as the patient` `a private in-patient` FALSE `an ordinary hospital bed` `none of these` EQUALS `the hospital's charge` (`a fixed charge of` 467)
-- item 1(b)(i): a ceiling
#ASSERT `What does the public hospital charge me per day for my stay` `as the patient` `a private in-patient` TRUE `an ordinary hospital bed` `none of these` EQUALS `the hospital's charge` (`a charge of no more than` 774)
