#ASSERT `What does the public hospital charge me per day for my stay` `as the patient` `a compensable in-patient` FALSE `a hospital bed, ventilator dependent with tracheostomy and 24-hour individual care` `motor vehicle third party insurance applies, or appears to apply, to paying for my treatment` EQUALS `the hospital's charge` `nothing to pay`
-- item 6(d)
#ASSERT `What does the public hospital charge me per day for my stay` `as the patient` `an ineligible same day patient` FALSE `an ordinary hospital bed` `none of these` EQUALS `the hospital's charge` (`a fixed charge of` 3258)
-- finding 8
